WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:01.000
Leviatan Episode 5 "I'm
Going on Vacation!"

00:44.160 --> 00:45.800
Onii-chan...

00:48.950 --> 00:51.520
When the people were judged,

00:52.180 --> 00:58.250
stones wrapped in fire scattered from the heavens and tore the stars from the sky.

00:59.020 --> 01:01.270
There was more than one.

01:01.810 --> 01:07.760
Several among them manifested,
their forms like mountains.

02:52.550 --> 02:55.810
Onii-chan, where are you now?

02:58.130 --> 02:59.300
Why?

03:00.370 --> 03:02.590
Why did you leave without saying anything?

03:03.540 --> 03:04.580
Onii-chan...

03:08.720 --> 03:12.170
I'm Going on Vacation!

03:10.520 --> 03:12.780
Vacation, vacation.

03:12.780 --> 03:15.280
Vacationing on the beach.

03:15.280 --> 03:17.170
Vacation, vacation.

03:17.170 --> 03:19.710
Vacationing at our villa.

03:19.710 --> 03:24.360
Vacation, vacation,
vacationing in the waves.

03:25.500 --> 03:30.350
Vacation, vacation, vaca-vaca-vacation.

03:31.170 --> 03:34.920
Miss, are you taking all
of this luggage with you?

03:34.920 --> 03:36.770
It's very heavy.

03:38.040 --> 03:39.720
It's okay.

03:39.720 --> 03:42.570
I hired someone to carry my luggage for me.

03:46.750 --> 03:48.630
I'll see you later.

03:48.630 --> 03:50.800
Bon voyage, miss.

03:51.740 --> 03:54.090
Come on. Let's go, hireling.

03:54.440 --> 03:55.570
Okay.

04:04.990 --> 04:07.410
You're eating something tasty-looking.

04:07.410 --> 04:10.070
Say, where did you buy this?

04:10.070 --> 04:12.560
The barkeep of the Key Tail gave it to me.

04:12.940 --> 04:15.100
Lucky you.

04:15.100 --> 04:17.130
I want one, too.

04:22.020 --> 04:24.060
That was delicious.

04:24.060 --> 04:25.420
That's great.

04:25.420 --> 04:26.630
This way.

04:26.630 --> 04:27.530
Okay.

04:28.120 --> 04:29.660
Oh, Leviatan and...

04:29.660 --> 04:31.140
Wait, wait.

04:34.910 --> 04:35.620
Syrorin.

04:35.620 --> 04:39.870
Wrong! My name's not Syrorin, it's Syrop!

04:39.870 --> 04:41.810
Jörurun, you idiot!

04:42.230 --> 04:43.510
Who cares what your name is?

04:43.510 --> 04:45.250
I do!

04:46.100 --> 04:47.850
You have so much luggage.

04:48.650 --> 04:49.890
Are you going somewhere?

04:50.170 --> 04:53.140
Yes, to my villa on the beach.

04:54.410 --> 04:55.640
The beach...

05:01.260 --> 05:03.300
We're friends.

05:03.700 --> 05:04.530
Huh?

05:14.710 --> 05:18.420
What do you think you're doing,
suddenly coming with me?

05:20.190 --> 05:21.880
We're friends.

05:24.720 --> 05:26.670
Okay, I get it!

05:29.040 --> 05:31.470
If this group is going to the beach together...

05:31.760 --> 05:34.730
It's an Aquafall Defense strengthening trip.

05:34.730 --> 05:37.030
My vacation!

05:55.350 --> 05:59.460
It's a long walk from the
stagecoach, isn't it?

05:59.460 --> 06:02.460
You're not walking at all.

06:04.950 --> 06:06.250
I can see it!

06:07.490 --> 06:08.920
It's the ocean.

06:08.920 --> 06:11.230
It's still a long way off.

06:22.490 --> 06:24.460
Miss Bahamut!

06:26.000 --> 06:28.820
You've grown so much since I last saw you.

06:29.220 --> 06:35.450
Please, Grandfather. This beautiful
girl must be the lady.

06:36.580 --> 06:39.460
But I'm the lady...

06:41.410 --> 06:44.880
It's been such a long time,
I didn't recognize you.

06:45.420 --> 06:50.200
You were so little the last
time you came to this villa.

06:51.230 --> 06:54.060
How many years ago was that?

06:54.060 --> 06:57.690
I believe your father
came with you that time.

06:58.120 --> 06:59.420
That's right.

06:59.420 --> 07:02.650
Your father was busy with work,

07:02.650 --> 07:05.150
even though you had come to the villa.

07:05.150 --> 07:10.590
So you tried to get his attention by lying
about a monster coming out of the ocean.

07:11.390 --> 07:13.580
That did happen.

07:13.580 --> 07:18.400
I can still see your father spanking you
until your bottom was bright red,

07:18.400 --> 07:20.910
when he found out you were lying.

07:20.910 --> 07:23.330
Let's not talk about the past!

07:23.960 --> 07:29.340
Speaking of bottoms, Miss,
has that bruise gone away yet?

07:31.000 --> 07:34.340
I said, let's not talk about the past any more!

07:39.940 --> 07:42.370
All right! It's the ocean!

07:43.790 --> 07:44.960
Hey!

07:45.420 --> 07:48.360
Don't goof off while you're on the clock.

07:49.190 --> 07:51.770
This swim suit is a little tight.

07:51.770 --> 07:54.160
Don't borrow someone else's
swim suit and complain about it!

07:54.860 --> 07:56.490
There, there!

07:55.170 --> 07:56.490
Hey, stop that!

07:56.900 --> 07:58.240
Counterattack!

07:57.330 --> 07:58.240
You got me!

07:58.840 --> 08:02.250
Stop that! Don't be cruel to fairies!

08:04.590 --> 08:07.760
No, this isn't the place.

08:10.120 --> 08:11.710
This isn't it, either.

08:17.200 --> 08:20.060
No, this isn't it, either.

08:21.170 --> 08:22.360
Hey!

08:23.510 --> 08:26.480
Why have you been wandering
around by yourself?

08:32.000 --> 08:32.990
What?

08:32.990 --> 08:35.360
You're looking for the place
you saw in your dream?

08:35.820 --> 08:36.710
Yes.

08:36.710 --> 08:38.490
I'm flabbergasted.

08:38.490 --> 08:41.490
That's why you said you
were coming with me.

08:42.840 --> 08:45.470
My brother appeared in my dream.

08:45.960 --> 08:49.650
He pointed at the ocean and seemed
like he wanted to say something.

08:49.650 --> 08:52.960
What? Leviatan,
you have an older brother?

08:52.960 --> 08:56.020
Yes, but not anymore.

08:57.110 --> 09:00.550
He left one day and never returned.

09:01.940 --> 09:04.310
The only thing I have left is this spear.

09:08.910 --> 09:13.380
I thought I might be able
to find a clue of some kind,

09:13.380 --> 09:16.530
if I went to the place in my dream.

09:17.280 --> 09:20.990
Okay, got it. I'll help you look for it.

09:20.990 --> 09:22.400
What an idiot.

09:22.400 --> 09:25.350
There's no way a place you saw
in your dream actually exists.

09:25.350 --> 09:27.270
It could have been a prophetic dream—

09:27.270 --> 09:31.820
Even if it were, it might not
be anywhere near this beach.

09:32.290 --> 09:33.450
Oh, right.

09:38.400 --> 09:40.840
We came all the way to the beach.

09:40.840 --> 09:42.740
Don't look so down.

09:42.740 --> 09:45.930
It's too bad we couldn't find
the place you were looking for,

09:46.320 --> 09:48.090
but let's try to have fun together.

09:48.090 --> 09:49.440
That's right.

09:49.440 --> 09:53.000
We have to make the most of this
Aquafall Defense strengthening trip.

09:53.000 --> 09:56.440
No, it's my vacation!

10:05.720 --> 10:06.950
There!

10:10.960 --> 10:11.770
Here!

10:12.180 --> 10:12.960
All right!

10:24.440 --> 10:25.780
Are you okay?

10:31.050 --> 10:32.420
Thanks for waiting.

10:34.030 --> 10:35.190
I brought it.

10:35.760 --> 10:37.100
Thanks.

10:37.100 --> 10:38.800
It's almost complete.

10:38.800 --> 10:41.530
Good work, everyone.

10:42.080 --> 10:43.090
There.

10:46.250 --> 10:49.140
I declare this castle Castle Syrop.

10:53.530 --> 10:56.550
My king, it's an emergency.
A mysterious meteor is...

11:00.310 --> 11:02.590
How do you like the
power of the meteorite?

11:31.270 --> 11:33.050
You're good at swimming.

11:33.460 --> 11:35.160
Yeah, I guess.

11:35.160 --> 11:39.710
It's weird for you to be a good
swimmer when you're a fire user.

11:41.720 --> 11:43.350
Oh, shut up.

11:43.350 --> 11:46.070
I'll get better at using
fire magic eventually...

11:48.140 --> 11:50.180
Yahoo!

11:59.430 --> 12:01.610
Where did that wave come from?

12:01.840 --> 12:03.040
Look at that.

12:10.900 --> 12:12.150
Oh, I see.

12:12.150 --> 12:15.060
Leviatan was controlling
the waves with her magic.

12:15.060 --> 12:18.440
I could tell right away
she was talented.

12:22.180 --> 12:24.110
You've got a long way to go.

12:25.380 --> 12:28.110
You have a great natural
talent for magic,

12:28.110 --> 12:30.360
but you're not making use of it at all.

12:31.180 --> 12:32.140
Who are you?

12:33.590 --> 12:37.900
See? You lose your focus just a little,
and things go awry.

12:53.540 --> 12:55.670
What a surprise!

13:04.250 --> 13:05.510
He's gone.

13:13.750 --> 13:15.370
I'm hungry.

13:15.370 --> 13:17.530
We played so much.

13:17.530 --> 13:19.970
I'm starving, too.

13:19.970 --> 13:22.360
Leviatan, you're hungry, right?

13:22.360 --> 13:23.990
Y-Yeah...

13:24.580 --> 13:27.250
Let's set up the barbecue and eat.

13:27.250 --> 13:28.860
I've been waiting for you to say that!

13:28.860 --> 13:32.090
Just so you know, I didn't bring
anything for hirelings to eat.

13:32.090 --> 13:35.180
What? You're not feeding me
three meals plus snacks?

13:35.180 --> 13:36.120
No!

13:36.750 --> 13:40.170
Fine, then. I'll procure
my own share myself, then.

13:40.690 --> 13:43.000
Procure?

13:48.240 --> 13:50.510
There should be some around here...

13:51.190 --> 13:52.740
There's one.

13:53.620 --> 13:55.520
You're going to eat that?

13:55.940 --> 13:59.230
No, I'm going to use this as bait.

14:03.390 --> 14:07.650
I see. You're going to catch fish and eat them.

14:08.020 --> 14:10.890
Is fishing really that easy?

14:10.890 --> 14:13.660
It's easy. Anyone can do it.

14:17.900 --> 14:19.150
There's one!

14:19.150 --> 14:20.040
Fish!

14:24.330 --> 14:26.260
Amazing.

14:27.050 --> 14:28.370
Nice work!

14:29.890 --> 14:31.640
You caught a whole bunch.

14:32.190 --> 14:34.470
Maybe I'll try it, too.

14:38.520 --> 14:40.580
All right! Another one!

14:40.580 --> 14:42.310
Amazing!

14:42.310 --> 14:44.480
More, more fish!

14:44.950 --> 14:46.790
They're biting at every cast.

14:56.830 --> 14:59.750
Oh, another one! Fish!

15:00.130 --> 15:01.920
That should be enough.

15:02.530 --> 15:03.580
Well, then...

15:03.580 --> 15:05.060
Hold on!

15:05.600 --> 15:07.260
I still haven't caught anything yet!

15:07.260 --> 15:10.290
Yeah, but this should be plenty...

15:10.290 --> 15:12.470
We're going to keep fishing
until I catch something!

16:19.400 --> 16:21.020
There is it! I got one!

16:21.590 --> 16:23.680
Wh-Wh-What am I supposed to do?

16:23.680 --> 16:26.360
Pull! Carefully, so you don't lose it!

16:26.360 --> 16:27.840
Stronger!

16:27.840 --> 16:30.960
Let it go a little bit! Now, pull!

16:32.510 --> 16:33.340
You can do it!

16:34.640 --> 16:36.840
Calm down! Unify your movements!

16:36.840 --> 16:38.490
Carefully! You can do it!

16:38.490 --> 16:39.350
Go! You can do it!

16:40.140 --> 16:42.770
Fish!

16:43.390 --> 16:44.870
All right!

16:47.730 --> 16:51.160
Take it off!

16:54.820 --> 16:57.880
Take it off! Take it off, quickly!

16:57.880 --> 16:59.970
Hurry up!

17:03.090 --> 17:04.870
I got it!

17:45.190 --> 17:48.630
Fireball!

17:56.870 --> 17:58.590
All right!

18:06.880 --> 18:09.810
Okay, now we're ready!

18:12.660 --> 18:13.820
That smells good.

18:14.240 --> 18:16.790
Do you think it's ready to eat?

18:16.790 --> 18:18.980
You're right. It's good meat,

18:18.980 --> 18:21.480
so it might better not to overcook it.

18:31.830 --> 18:33.300
Is this...

18:36.790 --> 18:37.630
Huh?

18:43.960 --> 18:46.270
It looks just like the
place I saw in my dream...

20:12.850 --> 20:20.690
Next Episode

20:15.770 --> 20:20.690
I'll Have My Revenge!
